# global-arret-read: Can a formula read `arret` when only a global action assigns it (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: error
# pc: ODE0039
# ruling: `arret` is an action, not a value. Reading it is an undefined name (language.md, Statement details).
x'=1
x(0)=0
global 1 x-0.55 {arret=1}
aux a=arret
@ total=2,dt=0.1,meth=euler
